DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17599::$$$message_0132_0000_0000$$$::"...All right, I think this is it."[lr]::
17600::$$$message_0132_0000_0001$$$::As I brew tea in the kitchen, I murmur the usual line. It's disappointing, but I still can't brew tea that she would be satisfied with.::
17601::$$$message_0132_0001_0000$$$::"She's fired up today too..."[lr]::
17602::$$$message_0132_0001_0001$$$::She's reorganizing her closet for the new season.[lr]::
17603::$$$message_0132_0001_0002$$$::She's causing a big commotion, turning her closet inside out, saying she couldn't get her clothes ready because she was traveling.[lr]::
17604::$$$message_0132_0001_0003$$$::What a big difference compared to me as a guy where I'm done right after switching the top and bottom drawer of the dresser.::
17605::$$$message_0132_0002_0000$$$::"...Well, I'm not able to help when it comes to that..."[lr]::
17606::$$$message_0132_0002_0001$$$::If I try to forcibly help, I'll end up falling from the second floor with the Gandrs.[lr]::
17607::$$$message_0132_0002_0002$$$::That's why I was having a staring contest with Tohsaka's complicated textbook downstairs until she gave the signal... And she called me earlier, so that's why I'm brewing tea right now.::
17608::$$$message_0132_0003_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, I'm coming in."[lr]::
17609::$$$message_0132_0003_0001$$$::"Sure... Ahh, I'm tired."::
17610::$$$message_0132_0004_0000$$$::"Thank you. Mm, it feels good to have a cup of tea after doing manual labor."[lr]::
17611::$$$message_0132_0004_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03a(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka takes the cup of tea and takes a sip.[lr]::
17612::$$$message_0132_0004_0002$$$::Did she really want the tea that badly?[lr]::
17613::$$$message_0132_0004_0003$$$::Before Tohsaka could evaluate my tea, I notice the clothes on top of the bed.::
17614::$$$message_0132_0005_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
17615::$$$message_0132_0005_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01a(中) textoff=0]They're rather unfamiliar.[lr]::
17616::$$$message_0132_0005_0002$$$::A black dress with a white apron.[lr]::
17617::$$$message_0132_0005_0003$$$::This is almost like...::
17618::$$$message_0132_0006_0000$$$::"It's like a maid's outfit."[lr]::
17619::$$$message_0132_0006_0001$$$::"Not 'it's like,' it is the uniform of a servant of course.[lr]::
17620::$$$message_0132_0006_0002$$$::I don't know how it ended up at my place."[lr]::
17621::$$$message_0132_0006_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03d(中) textoff=0]While sipping on her tea, Tohsaka is also looking at the maid outfit.[lr]::
17622::$$$message_0132_0006_0004$$$::Servant... Oh yeah, Tohsaka lives by herself, but come to think of it...::
17623::$$$message_0132_0007_0000$$$::"Was there a maid at your house?"[lr]::
17624::$$$message_0132_0007_0001$$$::"...When my father was around. The housekeeper that was working until I was in middle school went back home."::
17625::$$$message_0132_0008_0000$$$::"I thought I got rid of this uniform then, but it came out.[lr]::
17626::$$$message_0132_0008_0001$$$::I did find it, but I was wondering what I should do with it."[lr]::
17627::$$$message_0132_0008_0002$$$::"What you should do with it... Are you gonna wear it?"[lr]::
17628::$$$message_0132_0008_0003$$$::As long as they're clothes, that's the only way to use them.::
17629::$$$message_0132_0009_0000$$$::"...Ohh, so you're into that kind of stuff."[lr]::
17630::$$$message_0132_0009_0001$$$::"How did you come to that conclusion?[lr]::
17631::$$$message_0132_0009_0002$$$::What else would you do with it? Are you gonna frame it?"::
17632::$$$message_0132_0010_0000$$$::"Hehehe, I wonder. You were looking at Illyasviel's maids strangely, [cacheimage storage=凛私服01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01d(中) textoff=0]but are you sure that was because they're homunculi, and not because you liked their maid outfits?"::
17633::$$$message_0132_0011_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17634::$$$message_0132_0011_0001$$$::What an annoying smile.[lr]::
17635::$$$message_0132_0011_0002$$$::I-I was simply impressed at their thoroughness of wearing a hood on top of their white clothing.[lr]::
17636::$$$message_0132_0011_0003$$$::"T-Then, are you gonna wear it, Tohsaka?"::
17637::$$$message_0132_0012_0000$$$::"You're joking. Why do I have to wear a servant's clothes as the head of the Tohsaka household!?"[lr]::
17638::$$$message_0132_0012_0001$$$::I get yelled at.[lr]::
17639::$$$message_0132_0012_0002$$$::That seems to be her pride that she can't give up.[lr]::
17640::$$$message_0132_0012_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
17641::$$$message_0132_0012_0004$$$::I don't care about the rest as long as she looks good in it.::
17642::$$$message_0132_0013_0000$$$::"...But, yeah. Clothes are to be worn.[lr]::
17643::$$$message_0132_0013_0001$$$::If I had a choice, I would want Saber to wear it, I think."[lr]::
17644::$$$message_0132_0013_0002$$$::"Huh... Saber? That's also..."[lr]::
17645::$$$message_0132_0013_0003$$$::I'm not sure whether she would look good in it or not.[lr]::
17646::$$$message_0132_0013_0004$$$::No, first of all, she'll probably get more mad than Tohsaka.[lr]::
17647::$$$message_0132_0013_0005$$$::Saying, "What are you and Rin making me wear!?"[lr]::
17648::$$$message_0132_0013_0006$$$::But that is...::
17649::$$$message_0132_0014_0000$$$::"She's a Servant, so a Maid Servant?"[lr]::
17650::$$$message_0132_0014_0001$$$::"Yeah, it's a bit cliché, so I was trying not to say it, but I'm relieved that you said it just as I expected."::
17651::$$$message_0132_0015_0000$$$::...Just as expected, huh?[lr]::
17652::$$$message_0132_0015_0001$$$::I almost hug my knees and start sulking, but I suggest another candidate to wear the maid outfit without getting discouraged.::
17653::$$$message_0132_0016_0000$$$::"If you won't wear it, then what about Sakura?"[lr]::
17654::$$$message_0132_0016_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17655::$$$message_0132_0016_0002$$$::Why are you making such a serious face?[lr]::
17656::$$$message_0132_0016_0003$$$::I thought she would say things like, "What are you trying to make my little sister wear!?" Or like, "You shameless idiot Senpai!"::
17657::$$$message_0132_0017_0000$$$::"That girl seems like she would gladly wear it... And call you master... [cacheimage storage=凛私服11f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服11f(中) textoff=0]How dangerous, I can't show this to Sakura..."[lr]::
17658::$$$message_0132_0017_0001$$$::...A shameless, no-good big sister that mutters in a quiet voice.::
17659::$$$message_0132_0018_0000$$$::"What do you mean by 'master'? There's no way Sakura would do something like that."[lr]::
17660::$$$message_0132_0018_0001$$$::"Huh? Oh, did you hear me...?[cacheimage storage=凛私服13a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服13a(中) time=300 textoff=0] Ahahahaha."::
17661::$$$message_0132_0019_0000$$$::"...Well, it's fine. If Sakura won't work, then Rider's up next.[lr]::
17662::$$$message_0132_0019_0001$$$::Temperament and looks wise, I feel like it would suit her well."[lr]::
17663::$$$message_0132_0019_0002$$$::"...That's also so perfect that it's scary."[lr]::
17664::$$$message_0132_0019_0003$$$::If it's the reserved and devoted Rider, I feel like being a maid with Sakura as her mistress would totally fit her.[lr]::
17665::$$$message_0132_0019_0004$$$::Since she's not particular about clothes, I feel like Rider wouldn't hesitate to wear the maid outfit.::
17666::$$$message_0132_0020_0000$$$::"But Rider... Even though she looks like that, she likes to play with fire so situation wise... Hmm..."[lr]::
17667::$$$message_0132_0020_0001$$$::"I can't understand your muttering at all.[lr]::
17668::$$$message_0132_0020_0002$$$::That aside, the one who's left that would look good in it is..."::
17669::$$$message_0132_0021_0000$$$::"Ahahahahahaha!"[lr]::
17670::$$$message_0132_0021_0001$$$::Tohsaka suddenly laughs out loud.[lr]::
17671::$$$message_0132_0021_0002$$$::It seems like the person that popped up in our heads is the same person, but her reaction is the complete opposite of mine.::
17672::$$$message_0132_0022_0000$$$::"That's hilarious! Ms. Fujimura might be overjoyed![lr]::
17673::$$$message_0132_0022_0001$$$::She'll probably go to school like that. And, you'll have to do your best to explain why she's in a maid outfit!"[lr]::
17674::$$$message_0132_0022_0002$$$::She really talks like she's having fun.[lr]::
17675::$$$message_0132_0022_0003$$$::...But, I'm also starting to feel like that'll happen.::
17676::$$$message_0132_0023_0000$$$::"...It was stupid of me to think that it would be good for a moment.[lr]::
17677::$$$message_0132_0023_0001$$$::This has to be absolutely off-limits for Fuji-nee."[lr]::
17678::$$$message_0132_0023_0002$$$::"Yes, I would be troubled if I saw Ms. Fujimura like that at school, too. The sight of her in that outfit would make my abs hurt from laughing too much.[lr]::
17679::$$$message_0132_0023_0003$$$::But, it's certain that we can play a lot with this."::
17680::$$$message_0132_0024_0000$$$::Tohsaka picks up the maid outfit from the bed.[lr]::
17681::$$$message_0132_0024_0001$$$::She must mean that she'll put it away without disposing of it.[lr]::
17682::$$$message_0132_0024_0002$$$::But, I can't help but think about it when I see it...::
17683::$$$message_0132_0025_0000$$$::"...Heheheheh."[lr]::
17684::$$$message_0132_0025_0001$$$::"W-What is it, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
17685::$$$message_0132_0025_0002$$$::"Do you want to see me wear it after all?"[lr]::
17686::$$$message_0132_0025_0003$$$::"Hrk..."[lr]::
17687::$$$message_0132_0025_0004$$$::There's no way I wouldn't want to see it.[lr]::
17688::$$$message_0132_0025_0005$$$::But, it makes me hesitate to say that in a loud voice.[lr]::
17689::$$$message_0132_0025_0006$$$::...Also, who knows what she'll ask for in return if I become indebted to her?::
17690::$$$message_0132_0026_0000$$$::"But, well... I still want to see it, I think."[lr]::
17691::$$$message_0132_0026_0001$$$::"Good boy, I shall reward you someday for being honest..."[lr]::
17692::$$$message_0132_0026_0002$$$::She closes the closet and the maid outfit disappears into the darkness.[lr]::
17693::$$$message_0132_0026_0003$$$::Ahh... Goodbye, the one other great possibility.::
17694::$$$message_0132_0027_0000$$$::"All right, all done."[lr]::
17695::$$$message_0132_0027_0001$$$::"Tsk, good work.[lr]::
17696::$$$message_0132_0027_0002$$$::...Oh yeah. There was a part I didn't get in the textbook I was reading downstairs."[lr]::
17697::$$$message_0132_0027_0003$$$::"Oh, I have time, so I'll teach you.[lr]::
17698::$$$message_0132_0027_0004$$$::Bring it here."[lr]::
17699::$$$message_0132_0027_0005$$$::"Thanks, Tohsaka. Looking forward to your guidance as always..."::
917672::$$$message_9132_0022_0000$$$::"That's hilarious! Ms. Fujimura might be overjoyed!"::

